<article class="space-y-12 text-gray-800 leading-relaxed [&_h1]:text-3xl [&_h1]:font-bold [&_h2]:mt-6 [&_h2]:text-lg [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_p]:mt-2 [&_a]:text-blue-700 [&_a]:underline">
